      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2933676038,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "What are the warning messages and can they be addressed?  Wouldn't we prefer stricter/more conformant XML files?",
          "author": {
            "id": 8399509,
            "username": "mmann78",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Michael Mann",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fad119898ba16a3f8be2f765dcff399098444abd4f85a04d4c3ef415a2bbe3d9?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mmann78"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:02:56.958Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-12-04T16:11:04.274Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 438017711,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 22604,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2933698796,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "In this case, libxml2 is used to parse the capture file.  We have no control over the strictness/conformance of the input file.\n\nIs your suggestion that we should convert these warnings into errors and refuse to read a capture file which raises warnings?  I'd be OK with that approach too, in theory, but we'd need to verify that common input files don't actually raise any warnings.\n\nThe current situation is that parse warnings are simply printed to stderr and then ignored, which seems quite unproductive... unless we actually have an expectation that folks using this wiretap parser will watch their stderr for warnings.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7889756,
            "username": "dariusd0",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "dariusd0",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f0f4a609abaf984c9cfe277f1321b8db104aea7290fcbb7fb0c5749a00d32e39?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/dariusd0"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:11:04.224Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-12-04T16:11:04.224Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 438017711,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 22604,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2933819773,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Example of a warning from a fuzzed input file:\n\n```\n$ ../wireshark-ninja/run/tshark -nr 044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d -X 'read_format:3GPP TS 32.423 Trace format' \n044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d:1: parser warning : Unsupported version '1.'\n<?xml version=\"1.//www.3s/\">\n                 ^\ntshark: The file \"044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d\" isn't a capture file in a format TShark understands.\n```\n\nwith `XML_PARSE_NOWARNING`, this becomes:\n\n```\n$ ../wireshark-ninja/run/tshark -nr 044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d -X 'read_format:3GPP TS 32.423 Trace format' \ntshark: The file \"044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d\" isn't a capture file in a format TShark understands.\n```\n\nThe warning is also currently emitted when probing for the file type -- i.e. without `-X read_format:...`.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7889756,
            "username": "dariusd0",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "dariusd0",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f0f4a609abaf984c9cfe277f1321b8db104aea7290fcbb7fb0c5749a00d32e39?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/dariusd0"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:54:50.240Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-12-04T16:54:50.240Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 438017711,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
