          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2933958075,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think we need to inform the user if the xml is faulty. In order to fix Joackims open MR we need to do more xml parsing and at least one of the example files that can be found are missing closing tags, probably as it is manufactured but without the xml error it would have been harder to spot.\n\nTo fix joackims problem I think the old solution of converting the whole file on the first go would be easier. Unfortunately my poc blows up on writing the first packet...",
          "author": {
            "id": 6792385,
            "username": "AndersBroman",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "AndersBroman",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/132fb48f26018ea9516aea909144af3c3a94eaf2ba477efaa9a232abe80d322c?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/AndersBroman"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:59:45.152Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-12-04T17:59:45.152Z",
