        {
          "id": 2933980877,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> So in the above example, does wiretap say \"not mine\" for nettrace (with the version warning coming from xmlReadFile), try to match other file formats (also fail), and then results in a \"capture file format TShark doesn't understands\"?\n\nIndeed wiretap says \"not mine\".  In the absence of `-X read_format`, however, it ends up being matched by the mime_file handler:\n\n```\n$ ../wireshark-ninja/run/tshark -nr 044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d \n044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d:1: parser warning : Unsupported version '1.'\n<?xml version=\"1.//www.3s/\">\n                 ^\n    1                          →              MIME_FILE 1944  3c:6c\n$ ../wireshark-ninja/run/tshark -nVr 044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d \n044ca37c4b55b331b93439786ccad10023d00f0d:1: parser warning : Unsupported version '1.'\n<?xml version=\"1.//www.3s/\">\n                 ^\nFrame 1: Packet, 1944 bytes on wire (15552 bits), 1944 bytes captured (15552 bits)\n    Encapsulation type: MIME (134)\n    Frame Number: 1\n    Frame Length: 1944 bytes (15552 bits)\n    Capture Length: 1944 bytes (15552 bits)\n    [Frame is marked: False]\n    [Frame is ignored: False]\n    [Protocols in frame: mime_dlt:data]\n    Character encoding: ASCII (0)\nMIME file (Unhandled)\nData (1944 bytes)\n\n0000  3c 3f 78 6d 6c 20 76 65 72 73 69 6f 6e 3d 22 31   <?xml version=\"1\n0010  2e 2f 2f 77 77 77 2e 33 73 2f 22 3e 0a 3c 66 69   .//www.3s/\">.<fi\n[...]\n```\n\nI think in this case we should not have any such messages on `stderr`.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7889756,
            "username": "dariusd0",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "dariusd0",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f0f4a609abaf984c9cfe277f1321b8db104aea7290fcbb7fb0c5749a00d32e39?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/dariusd0"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:12:40.334Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-12-04T18:12:40.334Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 438017711,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
