          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 22604,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2933998392,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yeah, to be more precise, I meant nothing _directly_ emitted by libxml2 on stderr.\n\nIf it goes through ws_log and gets appropriately filtered according to the log level, that's perfectly reasonable, IMO.  But it sounds like that might not be an option while we support libxml2 back to version 2.9.7...",
          "author": {
            "id": 7889756,
            "username": "dariusd0",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "dariusd0",
            "state": "active",
